<PageLayout title="Master Playlist" subtitle="Every recipe's baking playlist, combined into one running list.">

  <p>Every recipe on this site comes with its own phase-based playlist — tracks picked for Starter Feeding, Active Mixing, Bulk Fermentation, and Bake and Cool. This is all of them combined into one deduplicated, phase-ordered listening document, plus a note on which recipe (or recipes) each track came from. It grows every time a new recipe does.</p>

  <div class="callout printable-extras">
    <strong>Printable:</strong>
    <a href="/downloads/Bruces_Breads_Master_Baking_Playlist.pdf" class="pdf-pill">Master Playlist (PDF)</a>
  </div>

  <p>This is a reference document, not a live streaming playlist — for now, the fastest way to actually listen along is to search a few of your favorite tracks from it wherever you already listen to music.</p>

</PageLayout>
